Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|web.server.display.node=true|
		|ext.plugins.includes|sample-ext|
		|portal.release.environment|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Test Plugins|


Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Sample Ext Plugin Validation Via Deploy
Priority: 5
	Given Portlet assert Server Startup
	When Portlet shutdown Server
	And Portlet assert Server Shutdown
	And Portlet start Server
		|deleteLiferayHome|false|
	And Portlet assert Server Startup
	And AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'EXT_ATOM_SERVLET_INSTALLED'
	And AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'EXT_WEB_SERVLET_INSTALLED'
	And User first Login PG
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'ext_portal_impl_installed_' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'DangerDue to inactivity, your session has expired. Please save any data you may have entered before refreshing the page.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And Refresh
	Then AssertElementPresent the value 'Sign In' at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'
Scenario: View Sample Ext Plugin Validation Via Direct Deploy
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|direct.deploy.enabled|true|
	When AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'EXT_ATOM_SERVLET_INSTALLED'
	And AssertConsoleTextPresent the value 'EXT_WEB_SERVLET_INSTALLED'
	And User first Login PG
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'ext_portal_impl_installed_' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'
	And Pause at locator '120000'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'DangerDue to inactivity, your session has expired. Please save any data you may have entered before refreshing the page.' at locator 'Home#ERROR_MESSAGE_EXPIRED_SESSION'
	And Refresh
	Then AssertElementPresent the value 'Sign In' at locator 'UserBar#USER_SIGN_IN'